# ABOUTME: What a Docker build must never see: local secrets, build output and machine-specific state.
# The build copies the tree; without this, .env (a real DSN locally) and node_modules would enter it.

# Secrets first: a .env in the build context would be baked into the image by loadEnv.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
keys/

# Local build and test output
node_modules
dist
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.prd-gate
*.log

# Agent and editor state
.claude
.opencode
.trae
.cursor
.vscode
.git
.github
.idea

# Nested installs and worktrees
**/node_modules
.claude/worktrees
schoolpilot3-*
